  title: White Ore
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>White Ore</b>


    White Ore is a simple glowing mineral filled
    with energy.


    Before it can be collected, the ore must first be mined using
    mine().


    After mining, use collect() to store the resource in your Inventory.


    Once
    the ore has been mined, you may also choose to leave it behind and continue exploring
    without collecting it.'
